silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_03_identity_discipline_sections_02_shared_arrow_discipline_yoneda_hom_legs silm:hasExample "In 'SharedArrowDisciplineYonedaHomLegs', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the upper-level arrow is an arrow of J^int (the upper-level index category), NOT an arrow of any per-entity D_e sub-diagram; this membership leg is the kind-discipline that blocks the cheese trap of treating an upper arrow as internal." .
